{"unit_id":"tag:03PF:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n粗略地说，大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site），对应于<MATH_0001>，由定义于<MATH_0002>上的概形（schemes）组成，其覆盖（coverings）为平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（coverings）。小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）景（site），对应于<MATH_0003>，由概形（schemes）组成，它们平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）于<MATH_0004>上，其覆盖（coverings）为平展（<ACCENT_0005>tale）覆盖（coverings）。事实上，任意态射（morphism），在<MATH_0005>的对象（objects）之间，都是平展（<ACCENT_0006>tale）的，依据命题<REF_0001>，因此为检查<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>中为覆盖（covering），只需检查<MATH_0008>为满射（surjective）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0007>tale）景（site）的对象（objects）比大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0008>tale）景（site）更少，它仅包含平展（<ACCENT_0009>tale）拓扑（topology）在<MATH_0009>上的“开集（opens）”。它是大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0010>tale）景（site）的全子范畴（full subcategory），其拓扑（topology）由大（big）景（site）上的拓扑（topology）诱导。因此，从大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0011>tale）景（site）到小（small）景的限制（restriction）函子（functor）确实正合（exact），且将内射对象（injectives）映至（maps）内射对象（injectives）。这有以下推论。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"s