{"unit_id":"tag:03PK:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>，并考虑函子（functor）<MATH_0002>，定义为<MATH_0003>。由《群胚（Groupoids）》例<REF_0001>，这是可表（representable）函子（functor），表示（representing）它的概形（scheme）也记作<MATH_0004>。由引理<REF_0002>，这个函子（functor）对fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）满足层条件（sheaf condition）（特别地，它也对平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）、Zariski等拓扑（topology）满足层条件（sheaf condition））。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"函子的表示概形。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"暂定译法。"}],"notes":[]}
